t":{"excerpt":"立法院已經要進入選舉了，不管怎麼樣，它是一個高度博奕的競技場所，但我還是比較贊成以對話代替對抗，無止盡的對抗對誰都不好，對立法院的形象也不好，所以我們希望大家能夠以對話代替對抗。","terms":["選舉"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"立法院已經要進入選舉了，不管怎麼樣，它是一個高度博奕的競技場所，但我還是比較贊成以對話代替對抗，無止盡的對抗對誰都不好，對立法院的形象也不好，所以我們希望大家能夠以對話代替對抗。","terms":["法院"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":0},"foreign_trade":{"excerpt":"過去對於美豬、美牛，行政命令改審查，在衛環委員會有8個嘛！","terms":["美豬","美牛"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"speech:4a4875effba2d896","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2022-03-17","date_start":"2022-03-17","date_end":"2022-03-17","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.09952267303102626,"government":0.47616348448687346,"law_crime":0.17628281622911696,"culture":0.051670644391408116,"cross_strait":0.07899761336515514,"energy":0.058681384248210025,"foreign_trade":0.058681384248210025},"citation_count":44,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/37/LCIDC01_1113701.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1113701_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"443-464","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"976c26e24a3b3ef9bdaa7ae816a809d2a6b597af7d6ea47b808edda62d20c79d"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/37/LCIDC01_1113701.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1113701_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"443-464","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"976c26e24a3b3ef9bdaa7ae816a809d2a6b597af7d6ea47b808edda62d20c79d"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/37/LCIDC01_1113701.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1113701_00011/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"443-464","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"976c26e24a3b3ef9bdaa7ae816a809d2a6b597af7d6ea47b808edda62d20c79d"}],"highlights":{"government":{"excerpt":"修憲已經走到這個程度，修憲必須符合高門檻，如果要修憲的話將來要公民複決，所以一定要對應到時間。","terms":["修憲","複決"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"law_crime":{"excerpt":"因為過去立法院開會都照人民團體的方式，所以雜亂無章，院會開起來，大家都程序發言，然後就搞不下去，一個人可以擋所有的人，所以才會有朝野協商這些，還有立法院組織法、立法院議事規則、各委員會組織法等等國會五法。","terms":["法院"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":3,"citation":1},"culture":{"excerpt":"全國最大的競技場就在這個地方，在野黨挑戰執政黨是天經地義，執政黨來捍衛也是天經地義。","terms":["競技"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":1},"cross_strait":{"excerpt":"1991年那次修憲把動員勘亂時期廢掉，所以兩岸才分治，這非常困難的。","terms":["兩岸"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":1,"citation":2},"energy":{"excerpt":"當初就是我用憲法第五十七條對於核四的重大政策予以變更，在程序委員會提出來，在院會表決，1992年5月的時候是歷史上唯一一次核四在立法院被廢掉，那是很正式的，用憲法本文第五十七條。","terms":["核四"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1},"foreign_trade":{"excerpt":"為了蔣萬安的事情，我們這一屆一開始的時候，為了美豬、美牛的事情，蘇貞昌問蔣萬安在美國有沒有吃過美國豬，蔣萬安聽到之後愣住了，隔天的報紙就寫說國民黨覺得是奇恥大辱，他們的儲君怎麼可以受到如此的羞辱？","terms":["美豬","美牛"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":1}}},{"event_id":"speech:24536948a67abe22","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2022-04-26","date_start":"2022-04-26","date_end":"2022-04-26","meeting_id":null,"meeting":null,"bill_id":null,"title":null,"party":"民主進步黨","dedup_status":"unresolved","topics":{"unclassified":0.7300664451827243,"foreign_trade":0.24335548172757476,"macroeconomy":0.026578073089700997},"citation_count":80,"citations":[{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/57/LCIDC01_1115702.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1115702_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"377-394","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"f07d3c9e614db768b0f15d567276907631388295c6aa7b35d5bbc04fcec52aab"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/57/LCIDC01_1115702.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1115702_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"377-394","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"f07d3c9e614db768b0f15d567276907631388295c6aa7b35d5bbc04fcec52aab"},{"provider":"lyapi_v2","source":"lyapi_gazette_transcripts","official_url":"https://ppg.ly.gov.tw/ppg/PublicationBulletinDetail/download/communique1/final/pdf/111/57/LCIDC01_1115702.pdf","link_kind":"gazette_pdf","source_url":"https://v2.ly.govapi.tw/gazette_agenda_doc/1115702_00010/parsed","verification_status":"third_party_transcript_unverified","printed_pages":"377-394","pdf_page":null,"speaker_label":"柯委員建銘","snapshot":"f07d3c9e614db768b0f15d567276907631388295c6aa7b35d5bbc04fcec52aab"}],"highlights":{"foreign_trade":{"excerpt":"第二個，我覺得今天只要先講一個題目，就是海關進口稅則，香檳酒的稅率20%降為10%，假如大家沒有異議，就先讓外交部回去，我們再好好談關稅法，好不好？","terms":["海關","進口","稅則","關稅"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":4,"citation":0},"macroeconomy":{"excerpt":"第二個，我覺得今天只要先講一個題目，就是海關進口稅則，香檳酒的稅率20%降為10%，假如大家沒有異議，就先讓外交部回去，我們再好好談關稅法，好不好？","terms":["稅率","稅法"],"cut":[false,false],"hits":2,"citation":0}}},{"event_id":"speech:1549c805b51f8a85","kind":"speech","activity":"speech","role":"speaker","date":"2022-05-12","date_start":"2022-05-12","date_end":"2022-05-12","meeting_id":"委員會-10-5-36-18","meeting":"第10屆第5會期司法及法制委員會第18次全體委員會議","bill_id":null,"title":"第10屆第5會期司法及法制委員會第18次全體委員會議","party":"民主進步黨","dedup